{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect huge amounts of energies and buy upgrades to collect even more energy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Collector is about automating collection and transferring energy between fields to manage resources. Each field is like an idle game in itself;<strong> play eight games simultaneously</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No clicking! Just mouse hover over energies to collect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate collection with upgrades.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017540/extras/6603d119a38fb6b82593c2cf065e69c0.avif?t=1769334497\" width=575 height=158 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare yourself against other players in the <strong>leaderboards</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several progression systems: Energy levels, player level, Hub upgrades, field upgrades, companion augmentations and power ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize and customize your own <strong>companion</strong> which follows you around.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017540/extras/1a8aab552758faa6b3439c97f845c98c.avif?t=1769334497\" width=575 height=104 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pimp your Hub with decorations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige system</strong> for resetting for permanent upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry about complexity. The game introduces new features incrementally.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017540/extras/steamdecr1.PNG?t=1769334497\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize power ups to your own liking, play your unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>500+ achievements</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017540/extras/steamdecr3.PNG?t=1769334497\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue playing from anywhere with Steam Cloud save.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasional quests for gameplay variation!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017540/extras/95ff5bc13d3dc53d34483aea2a8d9208.avif?t=1769334497\" width=575 height=120 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition side game</strong> that affects the main game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of hours of content!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come hangout in the official Discord server and discuss the game!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Energy Addict Green Fields - IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2017540/b92ca22c3a16fcfee358668e70631d64acea1176.jpg"},{"name":"Energy Addict Burial Grounds - IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2017540/7417817eaccfb67ce58f46efbdaae614b97a5598.jpg"},{"name":"Energy Hoarder Grass Fields - IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2017540/b18bb38c597214bc53b1d08e3755cf41ac61a345.jpg"},{"name":"Energy Hoarder Burial Grounds - IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2017540/530eaeeb5bb5cead18576d4651d783a6c6ab46fe.jpg"},{"name":"Energy-Phile Grass Fields - IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity